el run period, applications and submissions of investment products administered by IPD must be submitted via e-IP.\",\"unit_id\":\"u9\"},{\"quote\":\"1 Investment-linked assurance schemes, mandatory provident fund products, open-ended fund companies, paper gold schemes, pooled retirement funds, real estate investment trusts, unit trusts and mutual funds and unlisted structured investment products.\",\"unit_id\":\"u17\"}],\"distinction\":\"Under the independent-class reading, any IPD-administered investment product is within scope, including a product not named in footnote 1. The strongest uncertainty is the superscript attachment: the source places the footnote directly after “IPD,” which may signal a limiting definition rather than an illustrative list.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The assessed event is an application or submission covered by the selected control.\",\"name\":\"is_application_or_submission\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u1\",\"u3\",\"u9\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"IPD administers the investment product concerned.\",\"name\":\"product_administered_by_ipd\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u1\",\"u9\",\"u12\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The product belongs to at least one category enumerated in footnote 1; retained for comparability but not required under this reading.\",\"name\":\"product_in_footnote_list\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u17\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"Gregorian date on which the assessed application or submission is made.\",\"name\":\"submission_date\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u1\",\"u7\",\"u9\"],\"type\":\"date\",\"unit\":\"Gregorian calendar date\"},{\"meaning\":\"The assessed application or submission is submitted through e-IP.\",\"name\":\"submitted_via_eip\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u1\",\"u9\"],